{"seq":2,"slug":"reshaping-digital-entertainment","title":"重塑数字娱乐","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/reshaping-digital-entertainment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-ipod-and-itunes","title":"iPod 与 iTunes","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/reshaping-digital-entertainment/the-ipod-and-itunes","wordCount":1535,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"pixar-and-toy-story","title":"皮克斯与《玩具总动员》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/reshaping-digital-entertainment/pixar-and-toy-story","wordCount":1800,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 重塑数字娱乐\n\n乔布斯的影响远不止于电脑与手机，他同样深刻重塑了人类的数字娱乐方式。本章考察这一领域的两件代表作。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"iPod 与 iTunes\"——它们如何让苹果重返巅峰，并彻底改变了人们获取与聆听音乐的方式。第二篇文档讲述\"皮克斯与《玩具总动员》\"，揭示乔布斯如何在科技之外，开创计算机动画电影的全新时代。\n"}